# Terra, Magical Adept (CR 701.27, 712.14a, 707.2, 714.3a, 603.7): on turn 1 she enters and Bot1 mills The Misty Mountains Cold into hand and
# casts it (a Treasure for chapter I). On turn 3 Misty has a second lore counter and a second Treasure. Trance ({4}{R}{G}, {T}) exiles
# Terra and returns her transformed as Esper Terra, a Saga with a lore counter: chapter I targets the nonlegendary enchantment Misty (not
# Esper Terra, legendary) and makes a token copy with haste - a Saga, so up to three lore counters: none this time, so only its own
# chapter I made a Treasure (three). At the beginning of Bot1's end step the copy is sacrificed; the original Misty stays.

